{"articleNo":"2405","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2405&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009학년도 전기 졸업예정자 졸업유예 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.01.06","hit":"13755","attachments":[{"name":"졸 업 유 예 신 청 서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2405&attachNo=1888"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼옛체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 19pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009학년도 전기 졸업예정자 졸업유예 신청 안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 50%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">2009학년도 전기 졸업예정자 중 졸업요건을 충족하였으나 졸업을 유예하고자 하는 학생들은 아래와 같이 안내 하오니 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">신청하시기 바랍니</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◀ 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 ▶</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">1. 신청 자격 : 2009학년도 전기 졸업예정자 중 졸업요건 충족자</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -47.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 47.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">3. 신청 방법 : 학생이 “졸업유예 신청서”작성&nbsp; → “학사관리팀”(G456호) 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">4. 신청 기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2010. 1. 7(목) ~ 2010. 1. 11(월)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">5. 신청 장소 : 교무연구과 학사관리팀(글로벌관 456호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">6. 제출 서류 : 졸업유예 신청서 각 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">7. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">졸업유예 등록 : 2010. 1. 14(목) ~ 1. 15(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 기성회비 1/6 해당액(위 기간에 원스톱에서 고지서 출력하여 납부)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">8. 유의사항</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -33.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;① </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">졸업유예 등록까지 모두 완료하여야만 졸업유예 신청이 완료</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">되니 등록기간에 반드시 납부하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -32.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② 2010학년도 1학기 수강을 희망하는 자는 수강신청기간내에 수강신청을 하고, 학기초과자기준으로 등록금을 납부하되, 기납부금액에서 차액만 납부하면 됩니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -32.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;③ 재학연한범위내에서 가능하며, 최대 4회까지 신청가능합니다.(1회 신청시 한학기만 신청 가능.)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2009. 1. 6</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">교&nbsp; 무&nbsp; 연&nbsp; 구&nbsp; 과&nbsp; 장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
